DFlash speculative decoding with prefix caching: tokens restored from the
prefix cache never ran through the target forward, so their DFlash draft
context KV was never written and the draft attended to garbage. Track per
request the cache-restored token count (states.py), hand it to the speculator
(model_runner.py), and in the DFlash speculator shorten the draft seq_lens and
shift the draft block-table rows left by the restored whole blocks.
Backport of unmerged upstream vLLM PR #47926 (issue #47930). Needed for ornith
(Mamba-hybrid + DFlash) with prefix caching.

